{"research_date": "2026-09-10", "pairs": [{"pair_id": "conflict_9ae49d9df909b82059730fc2", "claim_ids": ["claim_3cd59a45ba081d3ed5fe4f57", "claim_581d3c4b5b7ac7a04ed6e3ba"], "query_ids": ["q_228"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_3cd59a45ba081d3ed5fe4f57", "quote": "Under CBP regulations, unliquidated entries must be corrected within 300 days of the date of entry (unless CBP grants an extension) but no later than 15 days before the scheduled liquidation.", "url": "https://www.buchalter.com/insights/after-learning-resources-v-trump-strategic-paths-to-recovering-unliquidated-ieepa-tariffs-through-post-summary-corrections", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"expiration_date": "15 days before the scheduled liquidation"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_581d3c4b5b7ac7a04ed6e3ba", "quote": "During the pre-liquidation period, importers or their licensed U.S. customs brokers may amend an entry summary by filing a Post-Summary Correction (PSC) through the Automated Broker Interface (ABI) within the Automated Commercial Environment (ACE) platform.", "url": "https://www.buchalter.com/insights/after-learning-resources-v-trump-strategic-paths-to-recovering-unliquidated-ieepa-tariffs-through-post-summary-corrections", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"legal_authority": "Automated Broker Interface (ABI) within the Automated Commercial Environment (ACE) platform"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_839be51dc08bc863c4e58663", "claim_ids": ["claim_591d8d016f8262cccced7c79", "claim_5ec099604d74bd0b523451d9"], "query_ids": ["q_228"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_591d8d016f8262cccced7c79", "quote": "The 180-day protest window doesn't pause. A missed deadline can't be undone.", "url": "https://ayarlaw.com/tariff-refund-resources/cbp-protest-tariff-refund", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_5ec099604d74bd0b523451d9", "quote": "A protective protest is a formal filing under 19 U.S.C. § 1514 on an IEEPA entry whose CAPE eligibility is uncertain. It preserves the 180-day statutory refund right while CAPE eligibility is confirmed or the Phase 2 scope develops.", "url": "https://ayarlaw.com/tariff-refund-resources/cbp-protest-tariff-refund", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_3fa6b515d3b38b1530f1dbee", "claim_ids": ["claim_6c401d7bd87b9dba4880064b", "claim_a05916217d9f61ab7bfc4744"], "query_ids": ["q_228"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_6c401d7bd87b9dba4880064b", "quote": "For an IEEPA protest, the legal basis is straightforward: the Supreme Court ruled in Learning Resources v. Trump (February 20, 2026) that IEEPA does not authorize the President to impose tariffs, and the duties collected under that authority are refundable.", "url": "https://ayarlaw.com/tariff-refund-resources/cbp-protest-tariff-refund", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"legal_authority": "Supreme Court ruled in Learning Resources v. Trump (February 20, 2026)", "reported_policy_status": "IEEPA does not authorize the President to impose tariffs"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_a05916217d9f61ab7bfc4744", "quote": "A valid protest is a prerequisite to CIT jurisdiction. Without a properly filed protest, CIT cannot review the case. Skipping or mishandling the protest stage permanently forecloses court review.", "url": "https://ayarlaw.com/tariff-refund-resources/cbp-protest-tariff-refund", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"legal_authority": "CIT jurisdiction"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_1ea7e045f189af6d4093c832", "claim_ids": ["claim_01bc05efc78f31e61bc56a96", "claim_71a18d50068330564d6bdaa5"], "query_ids": ["q_229"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_01bc05efc78f31e61bc56a96", "quote": "The products are unassembled chassis and loose components, including uninstalled wheels and tires, seats, roof systems, body panels, windshields, steering components, and accessories. Lithium battery systems are not installed or programmed at importation.", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/03/02/2026-04124/notice-of-scope-ruling-applications-filed-in-antidumping-and-countervailing-duty-proceedings", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_71a18d50068330564d6bdaa5", "quote": "The product is seamless steel mechanical pipe designed to be assembled into various final components after importation. The pipe is produced to ASTM A519 specifications and manufactured in dimensions ranging from a WT of 0.250 to 1.50 inches and OD of 2.375 to 14.0 inches.", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/03/02/2026-04124/notice-of-scope-ruling-applications-filed-in-antidumping-and-countervailing-duty-proceedings", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_e83165a875e394d23e2d727e", "claim_ids": ["claim_2356539914cde015fcc78110", "claim_5e99c1ec566329c52e0a1cc5"], "query_ids": ["q_229"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_2356539914cde015fcc78110", "quote": "A shipment of glass refrigerator shelf subassemblies contains aluminum extrusion components that are attached by welding to the subassemblies. Under the scope of the AD/CVD orders on aluminum extrusions from China, the aluminum extrusion components of a particular product or subassembly are subject to AD/CVD, and the non‐aluminum extrusions components of that particular product or welded subassembly are not subject to AD/CVD.", "url": "https://www.cbp.gov/trade/priority-issues/adcvd/antidumping-and-countervailing-duties-adcvd-frequently-asked-questions", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"affected_product": "aluminum extrusion components", "duty_rate": "subject to AD/CVD"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_5e99c1ec566329c52e0a1cc5", "quote": "Under the scope of the AD/CVD orders on aluminum extrusions from China, the aluminum extrusion components of a particular product or subassembly are subject to AD/CVD, and the non‐aluminum extrusions components of that particular product or welded subassembly are not subject to AD/CVD.", "url": "https://www.cbp.gov/trade/priority-issues/adcvd/antidumping-and-countervailing-duties-adcvd-frequently-asked-questions", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"duty_rate": "not subject to AD/CVD"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_c6f637b49ed3be3205dd4106", "claim_ids": ["claim_71a18d50068330564d6bdaa5", "claim_a7b3bebe57830e6f88b04210"], "query_ids": ["q_229"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_71a18d50068330564d6bdaa5", "quote": "The product is seamless steel mechanical pipe designed to be assembled into various final components after importation. The pipe is produced to ASTM A519 specifications and manufactured in dimensions ranging from a WT of 0.250 to 1.50 inches and OD of 2.375 to 14.0 inches.", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/03/02/2026-04124/notice-of-scope-ruling-applications-filed-in-antidumping-and-countervailing-duty-proceedings", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_a7b3bebe57830e6f88b04210", "quote": "The product is seamless mechanical pipe produced in compliance with ASTM A519 and API 19PT specifications or proprietary specifications issued in full compliance with them. Its dimensions range from a WT of 0.118 to 0.75 inches and an OD of 1.50 to 9.625 inches.", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/03/02/2026-04124/notice-of-scope-ruling-applications-filed-in-antidumping-and-countervailing-duty-proceedings", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_23695132344c2386193677bd", "claim_ids": ["claim_12a6f0273c23858cd241f69f", "claim_2dd1990bad82b1a0e1beabd5"], "query_ids": ["q_23"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_12a6f0273c23858cd241f69f", "quote": "With the introduction of US tariffs in 2025, automakers paused shipments, closed factories and held volumes at ports, leading to a year-on-year reduction in import and export volumes at the Port of Brunswick in Georgia.", "url": "https://www.automotivelogistics.media/vehicle-logistics/us-tariffs-dent-vehicle-growth-at-brunswick-in-2025/2653646", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "automakers", "tariff_program": "US tariffs", "effective_date": "2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_2dd1990bad82b1a0e1beabd5", "quote": "Despite all the uncertainty about how tariffs will affect auto imports to the Port of Brunswick, a new record is about to be set.", "url": "https://thebrunswicknews.com/news/local_news/port-sets-new-record-with-auto-arrivals/article_0eae1bb7-83e0-413c-a99a-8504ea8543ea.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "uncertainty about how tariffs will affect auto imports"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_f7190367155db1df2dc98059", "claim_ids": ["claim_37b968dc9cda365eeedb1f44", "claim_4765824d2160ad91112f9819"], "query_ids": ["q_231"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_37b968dc9cda365eeedb1f44", "quote": "Suppliers are forced to take tough cost-cutting measures, e.g. programmes to reduce material costs, cut capacity, relocate production and consolidate sites.", "url": "https://www.fti-andersch.com/en/insights/high-impact-customer-negotiations-in-times-of-huge-cost-increases", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_4765824d2160ad91112f9819", "quote": "Negotiation results vary widely - some automotive suppliers are able to pass on cost increases almost entirely to customers.", "url": "https://www.fti-andersch.com/en/insights/high-impact-customer-negotiations-in-times-of-huge-cost-increases", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_e9f7e250d9bbc45d6f3dc2dd", "claim_ids": ["claim_69a030abcf8d3f69bfaf9c92", "claim_d7ef2756a749765457ae67c7"], "query_ids": ["q_231"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_69a030abcf8d3f69bfaf9c92", "quote": "Only about 40% of Japanese automotive parts makers affected by higher U.S. tariffs have been able to raise prices to offset the extra costs, a Nikkei survey shows", "url": "https://www.alojapan.com/1437336/japan-auto-parts-suppliers-struggle-to-pass-on-trump-tariff-costs-nikkei-survey", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "higher U.S. tariffs"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_d7ef2756a749765457ae67c7", "quote": "Imported Japanese vehicles and auto parts now face a 15% tariff, higher than the previous 2.5% duty.", "url": "https://www.alojapan.com/1437336/japan-auto-parts-suppliers-struggle-to-pass-on-trump-tariff-costs-nikkei-survey", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "15%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_9a5abfed8c9da1940ddee172", "claim_ids": ["claim_199b2ddbde9b1e7d8e6842a8", "claim_9042ca7b535523c5b28d7e1a"], "query_ids": ["q_235"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_199b2ddbde9b1e7d8e6842a8", "quote": "Hyundai Motor is exploring plans to expand annual production capacity at its new plant in Georgia to as much as 800,000 units. The tariff policies of the Donald Trump administration are seen as a key factor accelerating the push toward local production.", "url": "https://finance.biggo.com/news/7c816f70-187d-4f54-84d6-c8c8f26bacb6", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Hyundai Motor"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_9042ca7b535523c5b28d7e1a", "quote": "José Muñoz, president and CEO of Hyundai Motor, said in a CNBC interview on the 20th (local time) that the company is reviewing plans to increase capacity at Hyundai Motor Group Metaplant America (HMGMA) from the currently planned 500,000 units per year to between 700,000 and 800,000 units by 2028.", "url": "https://finance.biggo.com/news/7c816f70-187d-4f54-84d6-c8c8f26bacb6", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Hyundai Motor Group Metaplant America (HMGMA)"}}]}]}

