      "classification": "different_products_origins_or_programs",
      "reason": "Both claims describe seamless steel mechanical pipe but specify different dimensional ranges (WT and OD) and specifications (ASTM A519 vs ASTM A519/API 19PT). This indicates differing product scopes or specific ruling applications rather than a contradiction.",
