      "reason": "Claim 1 reports the percentage of suppliers able to raise prices (40%). Claim 2 states the specific tariff rate applied (15%). These are distinct data points regarding cost impact and do not contradict.",
      "requires_current_authority_verification": false
    },
    "conflict_9a5abfed8c9da1940ddee172": {
      "classification": "complementary_or_no_conflict",
      "reason": "Claim 1 states plans to expand capacity to as much as 800,000 units. Claim 2 specifies the range (700,000 to 800,000) and timeline (by 2028). The claims are consistent regarding the production capacity expansion.",
      "requires_current_authority_verification": false
    }
  }
}
